{"2688960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternity's Echo: Patient Zero", "steam_appid": 2688960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rayne Williams, an elite operative of the D.I.B., your team is missing, your memory is hazy, and you are surrounded by both paranormal nightmares and mercenaries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AWAKENING IN THE CENTER OF CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open your eyes, you will find yourself in the middle of a nightmare where the flickering neon lights mix with the smell of blood and ozone. In this uncanny world, you must rely on both your weapon and the real-time intelligence from your partner Sam on the other end of the radio to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WAR ON TWO FRONTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight to survive in the desolate parking lots and market aisles of Winona. On one side, ruthless mercenaries are conducting a relentless manhunt to neutralize you. On the other side are the terrifying &quot;Spectral&quot; entities that tear through the fabric of reality and pass through ordinary bullets, and the biological anomalies that have overrun the town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track a missing child with &quot;Bioforger&quot; abilities and uncover what truly happened at the &quot;Ghost Station&quot; on this journey from the claustrophobic storages of the gas station to the flame-engulfed streets of Winona.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL PARANORMAL COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine your strategy according to your enemy. Take cover and showcase your ballistic abilities against armored Reaper soldiers, while utilizing special &quot;Resonance Bullets&quot; and UV technologies to eliminate the non-physical Spectral entities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TECHBLADE MASTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When firepower alone isn't enough, utilize your multi-functional knife, the Techblade. Neutralize enemies in close range, overload electronic door locks, or activate environmental traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCANNY ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed and tension-filled locations, from the bloody corridors of the Winona Sunshine station to the town houses warped by anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP INVESTIGATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the clues around you, examine the &quot;Silverlight&quot; files, and uncover the identity of &quot;Patient Zero&quot; behind this conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rayne Williams, an elite operative of the D.I.B., your team is missing, your memory is hazy, and you are surrounded by both paranormal nightmares and mercenaries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AWAKENING IN THE CENTER OF CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open your eyes, you will find yourself in the middle of a nightmare where the flickering neon lights mix with the smell of blood and ozone. In this uncanny world, you must rely on both your weapon and the real-time intelligence from your partner Sam on the other end of the radio to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WAR ON TWO FRONTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight to survive in the desolate parking lots and market aisles of Winona. On one side, ruthless mercenaries are conducting a relentless manhunt to neutralize you. On the other side are the terrifying &quot;Spectral&quot; entities that tear through the fabric of reality and pass through ordinary bullets, and the biological anomalies that have overrun the town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track a missing child with &quot;Bioforger&quot; abilities and uncover what truly happened at the &quot;Ghost Station&quot; on this journey from the claustrophobic storages of the gas station to the flame-engulfed streets of Winona.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL PARANORMAL COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine your strategy according to your enemy. Take cover and showcase your ballistic abilities against armored Reaper soldiers, while utilizing special &quot;Resonance Bullets&quot; and UV technologies to eliminate the non-physical Spectral entities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TECHBLADE MASTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When firepower alone isn't enough, utilize your multi-functional knife, the Techblade. Neutralize enemies in close range, overload electronic door locks, or activate environmental traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCANNY ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed and tension-filled locations, from the bloody corridors of the Winona Sunshine station to the town houses warped by anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP INVESTIGATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the clues around you, examine the &quot;Silverlight&quot; files, and uncover the identity of &quot;Patient Zero&quot; behind this conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "As Rayne Williams, an elite agent of the D.I.B you were deployed into the zone. Your team is missing and you're surrounded by both paranormal nightmares and mercs. Guided by your partner Sam, you must survive this chaos and uncover the mystery of &quot;Patient Zero&quot;.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, German, Russian, French, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/730065410df30c52d053fe6178034b39e156b291/header.jpg?t=1779456111", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960